OL,3,AHurricane Isaias downgraded after
OL,4,Amaking landfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FHurricane Isaias has been downgraded to
OL,7,Fa post-tropical cyclone the day after
OL,8,Fit made landfall along the northern
OL,9,FGulf Coast of Florida, bringing with it
OL,10,Fheavy rains and powerful winds.
OL,12,FIsaias - which is the first of the 2026
OL,13,FAtlantic season - is still surging
OL,14,Facross south-eastern parts of the US.
OL,16,FHundreds of thousands of households in
OL,17,FFlorida, Alabama and Georgia are
OL,18,Fwithout power, and each state has
OL,19,Fissued a state of emergency. There are
OL,20,Fcurrently no warnings in places after
OL,21,Fthey ended on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
