OL,3,AHurricane Isaias downgraded after
OL,4,Amaking landfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsaias is one of three storm systems
OL,7,Faffecting North America this weekend,
OL,8,Fwith the two others hitting Mexico and
OL,9,FSouthern California in the El Nino
OL,10,Ffuelled warm waters of the Pacific
OL,11,FOcean.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
